 "0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top"><img src="https://imag
 e.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A0zUWBtPIt7ppzmYzdaPNed2B6X.jpg" width="220" alt="Affi
 che de Bleach : The Diamond Dust Rebellion"><br><small>(劇場版 BLEACH T
 he DiamondDust Rebellion もう一つの氷輪丸 — Gekijô ban Bleach: 
 The DiamondDust Rebellion - Mô hitotsu no hyôrinmaru)</small></td><td wi
 dth="16"></td><td valign="top"><i>Action\, Animation\, Thriller</i><br>Jap
